      "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:18:11.514Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/surajbhosale003\">@SurajBhosale003</a>:</p>\n<p>Welcome here! Trust level is assigned to an user automatically based on post metrics (posts read, post replied, etc …)</p>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
