      "id": 476903,
      "username": "sanket_222",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:35:40.556Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The user trust system is a fundamental cornerstone of Discourse. Trust levels are a way of…</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sandboxing new users in your community so that they cannot accidentally hurt themselves, or other users while they are learning what to do.</li>\n<li>Granting experienced users more rights over time, so that they can help everyone maintain and moderate the community they generously contribute so much of their time to.</li>\n</ul>",
