      "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:42:34.980Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Basically, yes, it will take sometime.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SurajBhosale003\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"151451\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/surajbhosale003/48/89326_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SurajBhosale003:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So is there any est. time</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well … it depends (aside other things) on how many time you spend here <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Anyway, don’t worry about. Don’t need any special trust level for learning, etc …<br>\nRead a lot, get help and help others.<br>\nEnjoy the trip.</p>",
